.TH DNA 1 "October 2026" "DNA-Linux 0.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dna \- Native Linux (x86_64) Android ROM unpack, repack, and patch toolkit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dna
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]...
.br
.B dna-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBDNA-Linux\fR is a native Linux port of the Android ROM toolkit DNA-Android.
It provides zero-compromise x86_64 native tools for manipulating Android filesystem
images (ext4, erofs, f2fs), dynamic super.img partitions, OTA archives,
framework services.jar smali patching, debloating, and verified boot (AVB) configuration.

It can be operated via the command line (\fBdna\fR), an interactive full-screen
terminal interface (\fBdna tui\fR), or a modern Qt desktop graphical interface (\fBdna gui\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show the program version and exit.
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-project\fR \fIPROJECT\fR
Specify target project name or explicit workspace directory.
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Simulate execution without modifying the filesystem.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose debug logging.
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Automatically confirm destructive prompts.
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fIFILE\fR
Write execution logs to the specified file.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help message and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR
Check native tool dependencies and environment health.
.TP
\fBgui\fR
Launch interactive Desktop Graphical User Interface (PyQt6).
.TP
\fBtui\fR
Launch interactive Terminal User Interface (curses).
.TP
\fBproject\fR \fIcreate|select|delete|list\fR
Manage DNA project workspaces under \fI~/DNA/\fR.
.TP
\fBrom\fR \fIunzip|debloat|remove-oat|make-rw|decrypt\fR
ROM archive extraction and filesystem tweak operations.
.TP
\fBunpack\fR \fIbin|br|dat|img|zstd|super\fR
Unpack payload.bin, Brotli archives, transfer lists, filesystem images, and super.img.
.TP
\fBrepack\fR \fIimg|zstd|super\fR
Repack directories into ext4/erofs, compress with zstd, or build dynamic super.img via lpmake.
.TP
\fBresize\fR \fIIMAGE\fR [\fI--size MB\fR]
Resize ext4 partition images safely using resize2fs.
.TP
\fBconvert\fR \fIimg-simg|img-dat-br\fR
Convert between sparse/raw images or create transfer lists and Brotli archives.
.TP
\fBsuper\fR \fIsplit|merge\fR
Split super.img into chunk parts or merge chunk parts back into raw super.img.
.TP
\fBjar\fR \fIcore-patch-dsv|remove-apk-protection|disable-secure-screenshot|patch-all\fR
Smali bytecode modifications for framework services.jar. Includes Android 17 CompletableFuture crash protection.
.TP
\fBpatch\fR \fIvbmeta|integrity-fix|safetycore|privapp-permissions|disable-ota|disable-xiaomi-services\fR
Apply system property and AVB image modifications.
.TP
\fBplugin\fR \fIlist|info|import|run|delete\fR
Manage and execute sandboxed workspace plugins.
.SH WORKSPACE LAYOUT
Workspaces reside in \fI~/DNA/DNA_<project>/\fR:
.TP
\fBrom/\fR
Extracted contents of official ROM zip archives.
.TP
\fBimages/\fR
Partition images (system.img, vendor.img, super.img, vbmeta.img).
.TP
\fBunpacked/\fR
Extracted partition filesystem trees (system/, vendor/, product/).
.TP
\fBout/\fR
Repacked images and flashable outputs.
.TP
\fBlog/\fR
Per-operation logs and history.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B dna doctor
.br
.B dna project create myrom
.br
.B dna rom unzip miui_rom.zip
.br
.B dna unpack super images/super.img
.br
.B dna unpack img images/system.img
.br
.B dna jar disable-secure-screenshot
.br
.B dna repack img unpacked/system images/system.img
.br
.B dna gui
